      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "During the Civil War, Union and Confederate troops held Munfordville for five years, fighting over the vital railroad bridge.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://kygetaway.com/about-hart-county/munfordville/",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Battle of Munfordville in 1862 was a fierce clash that left the town scarred but historic.",
